1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:06,381
Everyone in a family has different needs, so an app shouldn't look the same for everyone.

2
00:00:06,381 --> 00:00:08,936
PNCC Care features two distinct modes.

3
00:00:08,936 --> 00:00:17,068
For older parents, 'Senior Safe Mode' strips away all confusing menus and buttons, leaving only giant, friendly controls.

4
00:00:17,068 --> 00:00:25,403
For adult children or caregivers, the 'Caregiver Console' displays an overview of all family members on one clean dashboard.

5
00:00:25,403 --> 00:00:33,872
You can switch between them with one tap, giving seniors effortless simplicity while giving caregivers complete peace of mind.
